          "evidence_id": "evidence-135cb2b83265",
          "exact": "LLVM’s Analysis and Transform Passes#\nIntroduction#\nWarning\nThis document is not updated frequently, and the list of passes\nis most likely incomplete. It is possible to list passes known by the opt\ntool using opt -print-passes.\nThis document serves as a high-level summary of the optimization features that LLVM provides. Optimizations are implemented as Passes that traverse some portion of a program to either collect information or transform the program."
        }
      ],
      "observations": [
        {
          "evidence_id": "evidence-135cb2b83265",
          "subject": "LLVM's Analysis and Transform Passes 文档",
          "predicate": "声明",
          "object": "该文档是 LLVM 提供的优化功能的高层摘要，并警告文档更新不频繁、pass 列表可能不完整；优化以 Pass 实现，Pass 遍历程序的某一部分以收集信息或变换程序"
        }
      ],
      "applied_rule_refs": [
        "EVD-001",
        "VAL-001",
