      ],
      "rationale": "claim 文本与 target 引文（evidence-135cb2b83265，区间 [0,458)）逐字一致，引文完整复现并支撑 claim 的全部句子：①“This document serves as a high-level summary of the optimization features that LLVM provides”对应文档定位为高层摘要；②“Optimizations are implemented as Passes that traverse some portion of a program to either collect information or transform the program”对应优化以 Pass 实现并遍历程序收集信息或变换程序；③“Warning / This document is not updated frequently, and the list of passes is most likely incomplete”对应警告与可用 opt -print-passes 列出 pass 的说明。各句均可由该区间原文直接定位，无超出引文范围的断言。来源为外部公开页面（origin=external，evidence_status=source-reported），仅一条证据且完整覆盖，故判定 supported。",
